dds to make the College Football Playoff?","description":"We are tracking the odds for making the CFP, earning a bye and winning it all.","published":"2026-11-20T20:32:41.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50532919/college-football-playoff-odds-predictions","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Miami WR Malachi Toney 'really close' to return after ankle surgery, coach says","description":"Miami star wide receiver Malachi Toney is about a week and a half from returning from surgery for a high ankle sprain, coach Mario Cristobal told \"The Pat McAfee Show.\"","published":"2026-11-20T19:00:33.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50542494/malachi-toney-nearing-return-ankle-surgery-coach-says","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Draft buzz: Interest in Oklahoma State's Drew Mestemaker could spur draft trade","description":"If the Titans or Chargers wind up with the No. 1 selection and stick with their franchise quarterbacks, interest in Oklahoma State's Drew Mestemaker could lead to a team seeking to trade up for the top overall pick.","published":"2026-11-20T21:59:31.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50541939/draft-buzz-mestemaker-spur-auction-no-1-pick","type":"Story","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Top 25 betting lines: UGA big faves over Gamecocks, Vols slim favorites vs. LSU","description":"This week's odds and FPI predictions for South Carolina-Georgia, Tennessee-LSU and more.","published":"2026-11-20T15:55:41.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/betting/story/_/id/50498153/2026-college-football-week-12-top-25-betting-lines-odds","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Kalen DeBoer says this is his most complete Alabama team","description":"Alabama coach Kalen DeBoer said this is the most complete team he's had since taking over for Nick Saban prior to the 2024 season.","published":"2026-11-20T16:07:14.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50541432/kalen-deboer-says-most-complete-alabama-team","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Alex Scarborough","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Can Nebraska's Matt Rhule end his drought against ranked opponents?","description":"Rhule and Nebraska face back-to-back tests against ranked opponents to end the year, marking an opportunity for the Cornhuskers' coach to end a nearly decade-long streak.","published":"2026-11-20T14:02:33.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50534102/nebraska-cornhuskers-matt-rhule-ranked-win-drought","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5138451/luke-reynolds","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Luke_Reynolds_(American_football)"},"pick":{"pick":43,"round":2,"team":"WSH","provisional":false},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Luke Reynolds (American football)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Luke_Reynolds_(American_football)","description":"American football player","touched":"2026-11-17T20:10:34Z","intro":"Luke Reynolds is an American college football tight end for the Virginia Tech Hokies. He previously played for the Penn State Nittany Lions.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Reynolds grew up in Westford, Massachusetts and originally attended Lawrence Academy in Groton, Massachusetts. He transferred to Cheshire Academy in Cheshire, Connecticut after his sophomore year. As a senior, he caught 48 passes for 754 yards and nine touchdowns. After the season Reynolds played in the 2024 All-American Bowl.\nReynolds was initially rated a three-star recruit and committed to play college football at Penn State. He was later reranked as a five-star recruit and the best tight end prospect in the 2024 class by 247Sports."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"Reynolds joined the Penn State Nittany Lions as an early enrollee in January 2024. He entered his freshman season as a backup at tight end to Tyler Warren. Reynolds finished his first season with the team with nine receptions for 111 yards and one touchdown. He played in all 13 of the Nittany Lions' games as a sophomore and caught 26 passes for 257 yards. After the end of the season, Reynolds entered the NCAA transfer portal.\nReynolds transferred to Virginia Tech, reuniting him with former Penn State head coach James Franklin."}]}}